When I try to add a covariate to the HN cos model it gives the following error:

Error:
Model contains covariate term(s): no adjustment terms will be included.

This is the code I'm using:
hr.cos.sea <- ds(data=SSdata1819cov, key="hn", adjustment="cos", formula = ~SEA, truncation = 2000,
+                                   convert.units=conversion.factor)

Is there a command I can use to allow the addition of an adjustment term?

