Date: Sat, 13 Jun 2020 19:36:22 +0000
Subject: RE: {Filename?} [distance-sampling] Fitting detection functions: Visually or AIC? / common(?) errors.
Message-ID: <H4ZNiA0UDf8.gaSvJ77tAgAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
